Hey there everybody. I've been working on lots things this week, some internal with the game but the majority are promotional aspects of the game. 

[h1][b]Character Voice Update Part 2[/b][/h1]
[img]http://cdn.edgecast.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/10324027/ebe665d37b3959c830c560f9bb4f991adf59ead6.png[/img]

I'll be working to get an update out tomorrow, this will encompass the second part of Amber's voices, to specify these are more location comments and kill remarks. Thank you to everyone for the positive feedback, I've been excited for a while to get some audio behind the character.

Later during the week and heavily during next week I'll be working to add the things I've mentioned for the [b]final patch[/b] to STLD Ep 02. This will take some time but I'll be updating you all with progress and screenshots and stuff. The final patch will include:

-one last new enemy, and a new weapon

-a slots system with new weapons to spend tokens on after you die

-achievements 

-bug refining whenever I can


